{"title":"Career Roadmap · Apparel Production Manager","role":"Apparel Production Manager","summary":"An Apparel Production Manager plans, coordinates, controls and continuously improves garment manufacturing operations to deliver the required quantity, quality, cost and delivery schedule.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Textile & Fashion Technology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Apparel Production Manager plans, coordinates, controls and continuously improves garment manufacturing operations to deliver the required quantity, quality, cost and delivery schedule."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Textile and garment technology"},{"text":"Apparel manufacturing"},{"text":"Production planning"},{"text":"Industrial engineering"},{"text":"Work-study"},{"text":"Line balancing"},{"text":"Quality management"},{"text":"Supply-chain coordination"},{"text":"Production costing"},{"text":"Lean manufacturing"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Workforce management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile progresses from understanding garment manufacturing operations to line optimization, production planning, quality, cost control and factory-level leadership."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech/B.E. Textile & Fashion Technology","Textile + Fiber + Fabric Fundamentals","Garment Manufacturing Processes","Pattern / Cutting / Sewing / Finishing","Industrial Engineering + Work Study","Line Balancing + Capacity Planning","Quality + Lean Manufacturing","Production Planning + PPC","ERP + Data Analytics + Supply Chain","Industrial Internship / Factory Exposure","Production Trainee / IE Trainee","Production Executive / Supervisor","Assistant Production Manager","Apparel Production Manager","Senior Productio